{"results":[{"description":"description: Creates and configures a durable AI agent hosted in Azure Functions using the Microsoft Agent Framework and Azure OpenAI services, enabling stateful, serverless AI agent orchestration with automatic HTTP endpoints and state persistence.
package: Azure.AI.OpenAI, Azure.Identity, Microsoft.Agents.AI, Microsoft.Agents.AI.Hosting.AzureFunctions, Microsoft.Azure.Functions.Worker.Builder, Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting
